OL,3,GNEWSAFive gang members jailed over
OL,4,Amulti-million pound drug money ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive gang members have been jailed for
OL,7,Ftheir multi-million pound dirty cash
OL,8,Foperation.
OL,10,FThey were accused of collecting,
OL,11,Fstoring and moving criminal cash - most
OL,12,Fof which related to payments for
OL,13,Fcocaine, heroin and cannabis - between
OL,14,FJanuary 2020 and June 2020. However
OL,15,Fnone of the men were involved in the
OL,16,Fsupply or storage of drugs.
OL,18,FAnthony Carroll Sr, 57, his son Anthony
OL,19,FCarroll Jr, 37, Ryan Carberry, 46, Marc
OL,20,FCooper, 34, and Michael Monaghan, 37,
OL,21,Fwere caught after police broke into the
OL,22,FEncroChat phone network in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
